      "a0000001-0000-7000-8000-000000000020": {
        "tag": "rich-text",
        "id": "a0000001-0000-7000-8000-000000000020",
        "content": "## Span Morphisms (projections into shared worlds)\n\nEvery morphism is a projection: Vat → World. There are no direct Vat → Vat edges. Meeting requires a mediating world. The signed edges encode whether the projection is active (+, initiating) or passive (-, responding)."
      },
